{"title":"Confessions of a Rotten Girl","artist":"SAWTOWNE","sourceId":"reference:YfhDxKDJl1rDIjZXxe3T","sourceHash":"d37fc535a60756e1a998935f151e4471e3d57c01370dcfbc259b2b3aa4d3b5bf","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36068008,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":2.32,"end":6.88,"text":"Dear God, I've come to repent my sins","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.88,"end":9.52,"text":"Let your blood wash me clean for I'm—","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":9.52,"end":15.84,"text":"I'm— I'm— I'm a rotten girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":16.08,"end":19.35,"text":"I swore I'd never sin again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":19.35,"end":22.19,"text":"But my patience's running thin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":22.19,"end":25.23,"text":"The temptation flowing through my veins","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":25.23,"end":27.44,"text":"I'm bounded by these shackles of shame","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":27.8,"end":30.63,"text":"I promised I'd indulge no more","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.63,"end":33.43,"text":"But my heart I can't ignore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":33.43,"end":36.19,"text":"In my dreams, they're turning up the heat","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":36.19,"end":39.0,"text":"I'm a dirty, rotten girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":39.35,"end":42.56,"text":"On lock, underneath the bleachers","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":42.56,"end":45.39,"text":"Just watch, look beyond the smoke and mirrors","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":45.39,"end":48.15,"text":"Heartstruck?! Shun the nunbeliever!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":48.15,"end":50.43,"text":"Our operation would never be complete","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":50.8,"end":53.76,"text":"Red hot! Tension with each whisper","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":53.76,"end":56.75,"text":"Snapshot! Quiet moans and muffled whimpers","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":56.75,"end":59.23,"text":"Come on! Can't you feel the fever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":59.23,"end":61.39,"text":"Rising up?! Rising up to the sky?!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":61.95,"end":64.79,"text":"As testaments echo, fear ignites beneath my skin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":64.79,"end":67.43,"text":"The Lord sayeth, \"halt, thy child, don't give in to sin\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":67.43,"end":70.27,"text":"It's driving me crazy, the urge to forsake thee","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":70.27,"end":72.55,"text":"Yet something shifts within this wicked bliss","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":74.16,"end":76.61,"text":"I swore I'd never sin again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":76.61,"end":80.09,"text":"But my patience's running thin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":80.09,"end":83.05,"text":"Student council breathing down my neck","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":83.05,"end":85.14,"text":"I wonder if they're hiding from me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":85.49,"end":88.3,"text":"Forbidden fruits before my eyes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":88.3,"end":91.37,"text":"And a taste that's so divine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":91.37,"end":94.21000000000001,"text":"My regrets rewriting history","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":94.21000000000001,"end":96.97,"text":"I'm a sad, pathetic girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":97.89,"end":99.85,"text":"Someone please tell me what to do!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":99.85,"end":102.93,"text":"Because, honestly, I just can't stop!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":102.93,"end":105.58,"text":"I've been trying so hard and I can't stop!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":105.58,"end":107.3,"text":"What would God think?!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":107.3,"end":110.13,"text":"And I-I know I'm supposed to be a good girl, but","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":110.13,"end":112.33,"text":"Somehow I just can't control myself!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":112.33,"end":115.53,"text":"Every time I see them, touching skin to skin","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":115.53,"end":118.5,"text":"My mind goes— my mind goes—","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":118.5,"end":120.09,"text":"Aaaaaaaah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":142.65,"end":145.21,"text":"Could Eve be our idol? Could she lead us through the light?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":145.21,"end":148.05,"text":"We'd all be disciples of her lemon-driven bite","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":148.05,"end":150.77,"text":"Can somebody save me? The urge to forsake thee","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":150.77,"end":153.97,"text":"Still, something shifts within this wicked bliss","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":157.49,"end":160.36,"text":"The power resting in my hands","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":160.36,"end":163.48,"text":"For my God has other plans","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":163.48,"end":166.28,"text":"In salvation, I can live my life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":166.28,"end":168.64,"text":"As an ordinary girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":169.0,"end":171.8,"text":"I can't resist it anymore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":171.8,"end":174.69,"text":"'Cause I smell slow burn galore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":174.69,"end":177.65,"text":"All the trauma from a cobblestone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":177.65,"end":179.76,"text":"Could never beat the devil in me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":180.16,"end":183.13,"text":"An honest sinner 'till I die","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":183.13,"end":185.92,"text":"What's the harm if I don't mind?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":185.92,"end":188.76,"text":"With the paddle that empowers me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":188.76,"end":191.92,"text":"I can live a sinful life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}